
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  PrgEnv-amd: PrgEnv-amd/8.3.3
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    This module can be loaded directly: module load PrgEnv-amd/8.3.3

    Additional variants of this module can also be loaded after loading the following modules:

 
    Help:
      
        The PrgEnv-amd modulefile loads the AMD Programming Environment, which
        includes the AMD LLVM Compiler. This modulefile defines the
        system paths and environment variables needed to build an application
        using AMD LLVM for supported Cray systems.
      
        This module loads the following products:
      
      	craype
      	cray-dsmml
      	cray-mpich
      	cray-libsci
      
      
      
      *NOTE: This list is defined in /etc/cray-pe.d/cray-pe-configuration.sh.
      
      


